        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Meeeeh… meeeeh meeeeh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeh meeeehhhh meeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meee meeeh meh meeeeh mee meeeh,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeh meeeeh meee meeeeh MEEEEH!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeeeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeh meeeeeh meeeh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MEEH! MEH! MEEE! MEEEEEH!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeeh mehhh meeh meeeeeh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeh meeh meeeeeh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeeeh  meeeeeeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…Me meeh meeeeh Mee meeeeh meeh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeeh… 🐐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐐 About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do Goats Dream of Golden Grass?</i> is a light, climb-based platformer <br>with simple controls and a gentle sense of progression. <br>Your goal is straightforward — reach the top and taste the golden grass waiting above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. <br>No pressure. <br>Just you and a goat taking small steps toward a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InputAction← / →MoveSpace BarJumpESCMenu / Exit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, simple to understand. <br>Play casually, take your time, and enjoy the climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, accessible for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual improvement through repeated attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful yet memorable journey with a tiny goat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet moment of satisfaction at the peak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for short, casual play sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Meeeeh… meeeeh meeeeh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeh meeeehhhh meeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meee meeeh meh meeeeh mee meeeh,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeh meeeeh meee meeeeh MEEEEH!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeeeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeh meeeeeh meeeh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MEEH! MEH! MEEE! MEEEEEH!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeeh mehhh meeh meeeeeh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeh meeeh meeh meeeeeh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeeeh  meeeeeeeeeh…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…Me meeh meeeeh Mee meeeeh meeh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeeeeh… 🐐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐐 About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do Goats Dream of Golden Grass?</i> is a light, climb-based platformer <br>with simple controls and a gentle sense of progression. <br>Your goal is straightforward — reach the top and taste the golden grass waiting above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. <br>No pressure. <br>Just you and a goat taking small steps toward a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InputAction← / →MoveSpace BarJumpESCMenu / Exit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, simple to understand. <br>Play casually, take your time, and enjoy the climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, accessible for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual improvement through repeated attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful yet memorable journey with a tiny goat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet moment of satisfaction at the peak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for short, casual play sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
